      "final_text": "美国市场：上周美国股票上涨（标普500指数 +0.5%，纳斯达克指数 +0.9%），软件板块表现突出（IGV +5.9%），大型科技股亦表现强劲（MSFT +6.3%，META +5.1%）。美联储主席沃什在杰克逊霍尔会议上发表讲话后，美国国债收益率走势分化，短端上行而长端下行（2年期 +11个基点至4.34%，10年期 -2个基点至4.72%，30年期 -7个基点至5.21%）。美元上涨 +0.9%，创6月以来最强单周表现；黄金在连续五周上涨后下跌 -3.2%；布伦特原油因霍尔木兹海峡流量增加的报道下跌 -4.6%。",
      "iterations": 1,
      "seg_status": "machine",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: US equities gained last week (S&P 500 +0.5%, Nasdaq +0.9%) with software outperforming (IGV +5.9%) alongside big tech (MSFT +6.3%, META +5.1%). Treasury yields were mixed as the short-end rose while the long-end declined (2Y +11bps to 4.34%, 10Y -2bps to 4.72%, 30Y -7bps to 5.21%) after Fed Chair Warsh’s speech at the Jackson Hole conference. The dollar gained +0.9% in its strongest week since June, gold declined -3.2% after five straight weeks of gains, and Brent crude fell -4.6% on reports of increasing Hormuz flows.",
